WEBVTT

00:33.001 --> 00:37.056
Is this really the proper path
for a knight such as me?

00:39.071 --> 00:40.056
What's that noise?

00:41.009 --> 00:42.023
I'll go check it out!

01:02.085 --> 01:04.004
You bastard!

01:04.046 --> 01:07.034
I still haven't gotten
the hang of using this thing.

01:07.034 --> 01:09.001
What do you think?

01:09.001 --> 01:11.005
Does it look good on me?

01:11.005 --> 01:13.006
What are you doing, Minister?!

01:13.006 --> 01:15.001
This is blatant treason!

01:15.001 --> 01:17.031
Treason?

01:17.031 --> 01:18.098
Oh, please!

01:18.098 --> 01:21.006
It's comical how ignorant you are.

01:21.052 --> 01:26.023
I'm merely fulfilling my duty
as a minister of the Kingdom.

01:26.023 --> 01:29.083
Because these are Her Majesty's orders!

01:31.078 --> 01:33.041
What about the princess?

01:33.041 --> 01:34.007
She better be safe!

01:34.007 --> 01:38.003
The princess is the least of your worries.

01:52.055 --> 01:55.027
All these colors are tacky.

02:03.048 --> 02:05.027
Where is my mother?

02:05.087 --> 02:07.023
What have you done to her?!

02:08.047 --> 02:09.073
I disposed of her.

02:13.071 --> 02:14.074
But why?

02:15.038 --> 02:20.036
The more deaths there are,
the more my powers return to me.

02:20.036 --> 02:23.037
Thus I set out to instigate war
between the Kingdom and the Empire,

02:23.037 --> 02:25.038
causing countless deaths.

02:26.000 --> 02:30.025
Borrowing your mother's appearance
made it quite simple.

02:39.065 --> 02:42.006
Did you really think
you could kill me with this?

02:42.006 --> 02:45.077
The sacred sword your people once
used to rob me of my powers

02:45.077 --> 02:47.061
is stuck inside that shark's belly.

02:47.095 --> 02:50.086
There is no one who can
stand in my way now.

02:51.006 --> 02:54.005
You were always such a good girl.

02:55.011 --> 02:59.023
An obedient little puppet who didn't even
realize that her mother was an imposter.

02:59.023 --> 03:01.045
It's a pity to lose you.

03:10.097 --> 03:12.063
Are you okay, Princess Fione?

03:17.061 --> 03:18.075
I'm fine.

03:19.071 --> 03:21.046
Damn imposter!

03:21.046 --> 03:22.097
Who the hell are you?!

03:23.054 --> 03:27.019
I suppose there's no need
to stay hidden any longer.

03:28.098 --> 03:30.082
Let me show you!

03:46.043 --> 03:49.046
The Undead King?!
That means...

03:49.046 --> 03:51.017
This war was all your doing?!

03:51.017 --> 03:53.021
Such a sharp mind.

03:53.021 --> 03:54.063
That's right.

03:54.063 --> 03:58.076
Your fiancée lost her life
in all the fighting, didn't she?

03:58.076 --> 04:00.072
You should feel honored.

04:19.044 --> 04:23.028
That pathetic maggot
didn't fall for my bait, huh?

04:24.012 --> 04:27.058
My deepest apologies!
I'm afraid they've escaped.

04:28.037 --> 04:30.009
Then find and dispose of them.

04:32.008 --> 04:35.033
I am going to steep
the royal capital in death.

04:41.076 --> 04:43.021
Mother...

04:54.036 --> 04:56.031
You must be strong!

04:56.031 --> 04:59.007
You're the Kingdom's only hope now!

05:00.024 --> 05:01.038
But...

05:02.095 --> 05:05.081
They're in here! Hurry and get them!

05:06.091 --> 05:08.066
Come, we must make haste!

05:18.067 --> 05:20.055
Don't make me laugh.

05:20.055 --> 05:22.026
If you're so afraid of disobeying mommy,

05:22.026 --> 05:24.048
then why don't you
be her little puppet forever?

05:29.064 --> 05:33.009
The look on my face really is pathetic...

05:33.009 --> 05:34.019
Princess?

05:34.019 --> 05:36.054
Break it down!

05:44.074 --> 05:45.071
Huh?

05:47.016 --> 05:49.037
Just surrender, Princess.

05:49.037 --> 05:51.089
You can run, but you can't hide.

05:56.029 --> 05:58.003
I've been holding back for so long.

05:58.055 --> 06:04.055
Because I was convinced it was what my mother
and our subjects needed from me.

06:05.003 --> 06:08.039
But that was wrong.

06:08.039 --> 06:10.004
This is my life.

06:10.004 --> 06:12.069
My happiness is what matters most.

06:13.015 --> 06:13.081
And so...

06:13.081 --> 06:15.081
What are you muttering about?

06:16.004 --> 06:18.046
Take pride in this moment.

06:18.046 --> 06:20.047
Because you, dear Princess,

06:20.047 --> 06:23.061
are going to sacrifice your life
for the sake of our kingdom!

06:29.011 --> 06:31.054
I'm fucking done holding back!

06:42.095 --> 06:44.087
Huh? What?

06:45.037 --> 06:47.055
"For the sake of the kingdom"?!

06:47.055 --> 06:49.025
Get out of here with that shit!

06:49.025 --> 06:51.062
Take this! You stupid asshole!

06:51.062 --> 06:53.006
Um... Princess?

06:56.081 --> 06:57.061
Cecil!

06:58.001 --> 06:58.094
Y-Yes?

06:59.029 --> 07:00.027
Time to fight back!

07:00.088 --> 07:03.058
Rally together everyone
who isn't undead yet.

07:03.058 --> 07:04.057
We'll attack them!

07:04.089 --> 07:05.081
Right!

07:06.051 --> 07:09.091
I didn't realize that she had
so much pent-up stress...

07:35.056 --> 07:38.039
It's the undead! Run!

07:46.049 --> 07:48.074
These screams are music to my ears.

07:49.018 --> 07:50.098
Beautiful.

07:50.098 --> 07:55.029
Cower in fear at the world of death,
lowly humans.

08:02.081 --> 08:07.047
You have all spent your lives
revering an unworthy queen.

08:07.047 --> 08:09.039
And now you shall die for it.

08:09.039 --> 08:14.022
You can do nothing except
curse the hand that fate has dealt you.

08:15.051 --> 08:17.035
That's not true!

08:21.098 --> 08:24.053
Listen to me! You mustn't be afraid!

08:27.049 --> 08:30.011
Don't let yourself become numb
with fear and despair,

08:30.011 --> 08:31.093
because that's exactly what she wants!

08:32.053 --> 08:33.097
Rest assured.

08:33.097 --> 08:35.087
Those of us at the castle will fight!

08:36.039 --> 08:38.037
So come to the castle!

08:41.038 --> 08:43.088
I am not going to hold back any longer!

08:47.012 --> 08:50.002
So the puppet thinks it can defy me?

08:50.086 --> 08:51.068
Too bad!

09:28.046 --> 09:29.081
Oh no, the castle!

09:35.047 --> 09:37.064
Well, if it ain't the princess!

09:39.005 --> 09:42.039
I've found my special dinner for tonight!

09:54.002 --> 09:54.073
Jackass!

09:54.073 --> 09:56.062
Where the hell do you come from?!

10:06.092 --> 10:10.017
Not Harley! You no eat her!

10:10.017 --> 10:12.007
Get bent!

10:14.091 --> 10:16.001
Take this!

10:16.058 --> 10:17.007
Oh, no!

10:18.061 --> 10:19.085
Mr. Fish!

10:20.032 --> 10:21.006
Harley?

10:22.001 --> 10:23.036
No!

10:23.073 --> 10:24.006
Who that?

10:29.014 --> 10:30.087
What should I do?

10:40.002 --> 10:43.071
You won't get any stronger
from changing your makeup.

10:44.009 --> 10:46.047
The castle will collapse soon.

10:46.047 --> 10:50.078
Don't you see there's absolutely
nothing that you can do?

10:54.094 --> 10:57.068
Well, it's good that I'm not alone, then.

10:57.068 --> 10:59.014
What?

11:03.056 --> 11:07.008
Guess who's here?
You little skeleton bitch.

11:09.066 --> 11:12.053
You fools interfere with my plans
at every turn!

11:23.016 --> 11:24.066
Shit.

11:25.097 --> 11:28.042
Talk about a chaotic mess.

11:29.044 --> 11:33.092
It's like armageddon and doomsday
are happening at the same time.

11:39.041 --> 11:43.085
Hey, when the hell did the princess
go off the deep end?

11:43.085 --> 11:45.035
Teenage rebellion much?

11:45.082 --> 11:48.015
Hey, does anybody have a mirror?

11:50.004 --> 11:52.019
Does my hair look okay?

11:56.005 --> 11:58.034
Great, she's using Harley as a role model.

11:58.034 --> 12:00.089
The education system
has clearly failed her.

12:00.089 --> 12:03.009
Well, I hope the transition
is only on the outside.

12:06.033 --> 12:09.003
Let's hurry and take care of this mess
before the world ends.

12:09.003 --> 12:10.054
I'm not busting my ass for nothing.

12:11.092 --> 12:14.009
We have to defeat
the boss up there, right?

12:14.009 --> 12:15.026
That's a fair bet.

12:15.007 --> 12:16.059
Look.

12:20.008 --> 12:22.041
It's Nana!

12:22.041 --> 12:24.093
Huh? Looks like he's in trouble.

12:24.093 --> 12:26.006
What are we gonna do?

12:26.066 --> 12:29.092
Our first order of business
should be saving Princess Fione.

12:29.092 --> 12:31.015
Let's split into two groups.

12:31.053 --> 12:36.033
Ah yes, the "rescue the princess trapped
in a castle" routine never gets old.

12:36.033 --> 12:39.001
Then you're in charge of that.

12:40.083 --> 12:42.062
I'm going zombie hunting.

12:42.062 --> 12:45.062
Me too! I freakin' love zombies!

12:46.005 --> 12:47.047
That settles it.

12:47.047 --> 12:48.051
Harley.

12:49.003 --> 12:49.075
Take this.

12:51.077 --> 12:52.074
What's this?

12:52.074 --> 12:53.071
A walkie-talkie.

12:54.017 --> 12:55.074
I only have one pair.

12:56.024 --> 12:57.072
Let me know if something happens.

12:58.003 --> 12:59.071
Oh yeah, this thing!

13:00.008 --> 13:02.058
Wait a minute.

13:02.058 --> 13:06.022
Have you been holding out
on any other goodies like this?

13:06.079 --> 13:07.056
Nope.

13:10.066 --> 13:11.031
Good.

13:12.082 --> 13:13.069
All right!

13:14.038 --> 13:15.098
Let's kick some ass!

13:30.063 --> 13:32.034
Annoying insects.

13:32.034 --> 13:33.083
Enchantress!

13:40.013 --> 13:41.086
Don't give me that look.

13:41.086 --> 13:46.001
You know what will happen
if you fail to obey me.

13:50.098 --> 13:53.061
I figured I'd get another shot at you.

13:53.061 --> 13:55.019
Time for some sweet revenge.

13:56.054 --> 13:58.094
Cecil, please go and assist them.

13:59.003 --> 14:00.004
But...

14:00.004 --> 14:01.002
Please.

14:01.087 --> 14:05.045
You and those people are the only ones left
who can save the Kingdom.

14:05.009 --> 14:08.045
I'll do what I can to help, too.

14:13.084 --> 14:14.091
Very well.

14:15.094 --> 14:18.096
Please stay safe, Princess Fione.

14:19.092 --> 14:21.081
I will. You too.

14:28.059 --> 14:29.093
Hot damn!

14:29.093 --> 14:33.027
Having a front-row seat to the zombie
apocalypse is a dream come true!

14:37.054 --> 14:38.091
What do you think?

14:38.091 --> 14:40.086
I call it the "Anemone of Death!"

14:40.086 --> 14:42.082
Quit screwing around and fight!

14:42.082 --> 14:44.045
How dare you!

14:44.045 --> 14:47.021
I'm putting on an Oscar-worthy
performance here!

14:47.068 --> 14:50.006
Oh, come on.
It's a Razzie at best.

14:50.006 --> 14:50.083
What?!

14:53.031 --> 14:55.043
Damn, our boy is losing his fight.

14:55.043 --> 14:56.065
You handle things here.

14:57.012 --> 14:59.058
Sure. Go give him a hand.

15:00.034 --> 15:02.015
And in the meantime...

15:07.084 --> 15:11.022
Looks like Colonel Flag and I get to have
a showdown with the blade maiden.

15:11.085 --> 15:14.043
You can survive a sword slash or two.

15:14.043 --> 15:15.089
So I say you take her.

15:18.004 --> 15:21.034
Seems like it's our destiny
to fight each other.

15:32.002 --> 15:34.045
Damn it! What the hell's with this guy?!

15:34.045 --> 15:36.012
Me not lose!

15:47.081 --> 15:50.053
Hell yeah! Now send him flying!

16:12.033 --> 16:14.054
Nice one, sea leviathan.

16:14.054 --> 16:17.049
You're the best brother
a croc could ask for!

16:17.097 --> 16:20.031
Eat shit, finhead.

16:20.031 --> 16:23.065
You need somebody watching your back
if you wanna mess with us!

16:24.045 --> 16:26.003
He does!

16:26.059 --> 16:27.003
Huh?

16:28.093 --> 16:32.005
America, motherfuckers!

16:41.093 --> 16:44.001
All we're doing is running away!

16:44.001 --> 16:45.015
What else can we do?!

16:45.015 --> 16:48.004
One hit from those things
and we'll be joining the zombies!

16:49.024 --> 16:50.009
Screw it!

16:50.009 --> 16:51.024
Wait!

16:51.024 --> 16:53.074
Hey! Why don't you stop being a coward?

16:53.074 --> 16:55.052
Get your ass down here!

16:55.095 --> 16:58.037
Are you sure you have time to chat?

16:59.001 --> 17:00.004
Run, Harley!

17:00.004 --> 17:01.025
Oh, shit!

17:06.042 --> 17:09.013
Clayface!

17:14.083 --> 17:16.032
Why aren't you finishing him off?

17:16.032 --> 17:19.014
Hey, jackass!
Are you trying to get me killed or what?!

17:20.022 --> 17:22.031
Wait! Why are you leaving now?!

17:22.031 --> 17:24.059
That's not how this scene works!

17:24.059 --> 17:25.015
Hey!

17:26.055 --> 17:27.029
Hold on!

17:27.029 --> 17:27.077
Huh?

17:27.077 --> 17:29.009
Wait, Clayface!

17:29.009 --> 17:30.074
What?

17:39.043 --> 17:41.037
Whoa. I'm still alive?

17:41.037 --> 17:42.067
Yeah.

17:55.007 --> 17:57.031
What the hell is that?

18:04.015 --> 18:05.087
Arthur?

18:05.087 --> 18:07.009
Is that you, boy?!

18:08.075 --> 18:10.004
Arthur!

18:10.078 --> 18:12.015
Seriously?

18:12.015 --> 18:14.007
- How does anything grow that huge so fast?
- You've gotten so big!

18:14.007 --> 18:16.002
- Did he molt or something?
- Who's a good boy?

18:16.002 --> 18:19.006
Aww, you came to save mommy, huh?

18:45.069 --> 18:48.075
She can block our bullets
and dodge fire!

18:50.067 --> 18:53.018
This is getting us nowhere!

18:53.078 --> 18:55.063
Check out this bone!

18:55.063 --> 18:57.078
It's so easy to smack them
around with! See?!

18:58.031 --> 19:00.074
Will you just use your brain for once?

19:00.074 --> 19:01.044
Huh?!

19:01.095 --> 19:03.078
I am, thank you very much!

19:03.078 --> 19:08.006
Like, it's easy to understand.
None of our normal attacks work, so...

19:08.077 --> 19:10.071
Give me time to think, dammit!

19:18.006 --> 19:19.076
Maybe...

19:19.076 --> 19:21.016
Hey, what is that?

19:21.016 --> 19:21.099
Huh?

19:23.005 --> 19:26.019
Didn't you know that implants
can make your boobs glow?

19:26.019 --> 19:27.051
Not that I have any.

19:27.051 --> 19:28.027
Who cares!

19:28.027 --> 19:30.027
Oh. It's this thing.

19:30.027 --> 19:32.017
What's with that gem?

19:32.017 --> 19:33.028
Why's it glowing?

19:34.024 --> 19:35.032
I know!

19:35.032 --> 19:36.025
It's magic!

19:36.025 --> 19:37.028
Huh?

19:37.028 --> 19:40.015
Don't start talking like
that friggin' hack of an actor—

19:40.015 --> 19:41.049
No, I'm serious!

19:41.049 --> 19:45.066
It really is magic!
I know this feeling!

19:50.063 --> 19:51.007
Hey!

19:51.007 --> 19:52.063
Just watch this!

19:54.078 --> 19:56.068
Look out, Arthur!

19:58.018 --> 20:00.001
That's never going
to work on me, you know!

20:01.006 --> 20:02.035
Bang!

20:08.095 --> 20:09.006
What the?!

20:13.042 --> 20:14.036
How dare you!

20:27.047 --> 20:29.095
Guess I'm just in the way, huh?

20:32.075 --> 20:34.005
Dammit! This shit never ends!

20:35.006 --> 20:36.008
No way I'm dying here!

20:41.001 --> 20:43.076
Yeehaw!

20:44.072 --> 20:46.061
Hey! No! No! No!

20:46.061 --> 20:48.002
Watch it, you idiot!

20:53.078 --> 20:55.082
I thought you'd be dead by now.

20:56.077 --> 21:00.026
Gee, thanks. You trigger-happy maniac!

21:00.026 --> 21:02.015
That's a pretty crazy outfit
you've got on.

21:02.015 --> 21:03.062
Don't make fun of it.

21:03.062 --> 21:07.004
This is the armor of a legendary hero
that's been infused with magic.

21:07.004 --> 21:09.037
So, how'd you like those bad boys?

21:10.031 --> 21:12.002
Well, they're not bad.

21:13.034 --> 21:16.005
I'll have to teach you how to aim properly
when this is over.

21:16.005 --> 21:18.038
You're gonna kill one of us
shooting like that.

21:37.001 --> 21:39.053
So hey, what's your goal here?

21:40.018 --> 21:41.004
Nothing.

21:41.004 --> 21:42.088
Quit lying.

21:42.088 --> 21:46.022
Something seemed off between you
and that skeleton bitch.

21:46.022 --> 21:49.041
Plus, using all this magic
made me realize something.

21:50.000 --> 21:53.054
You're the one who stopped
those bullets that one time.

21:54.005 --> 21:55.063
Isn't that right?

21:57.007 --> 22:00.021
Now that's an expression
I've seen before...

22:00.021 --> 22:01.044
Ah!

22:01.044 --> 22:05.026
It's how people look whenever Puddin's
holding something of theirs hostage!

22:05.065 --> 22:07.001
Bingo!

22:10.002 --> 22:13.005
That looks familiar.
Isn't that the dragon from before?

22:13.069 --> 22:16.009
Hey! Look over there.

22:19.017 --> 22:21.034
Doesn't she look a lot like Enchantress?

22:21.034 --> 22:23.087
Whenever a character with the same face
as another appears,

22:23.087 --> 22:26.053
there's always a good plot reason for it!

22:26.053 --> 22:28.002
I knew I was destined for this!

22:28.002 --> 22:30.055
I'm about to bask in the spotlight, baby!
